<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SimbIoT - Embedded Systems & IoT Hub</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #0a192f;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Efek Latar Belakang Digital */
        body::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(circle, #172a45 10%, transparent 11%),
                radial-gradient(circle, #172a45 10%, transparent 11%);
            background-size: 40px 40px;
            background-position: 0 0, 20px 20px;
            animation: moveBg 20s linear infinite;
            opacity: 0.4;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        @keyframes moveBg {
            from { transform: translate(0, 0); }
            to { transform: translate(-40px, -40px); }
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            padding: 20px;
            background: rgba(17, 34, 64, 0.75);
            border: 1px solid #306ee8;
            border-radius: 16px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            max-width: 500px;
            width: 90%;
        }

        .logo-placeholder {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #306ee8, #00f2fe);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(48, 110, 232, 0.6);
        }

        .logo-placeholder svg {
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            fill: #ffffff;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        h1 span {
            color: #00f2fe;
        }

        p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .status-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            background-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid #10b981;
            color: #10b981;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #306ee8, #00cbfe);
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 203, 254, 0.3);
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 203, 254, 0.5);
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00cbfe, #306ee8);
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #64748b;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Icon Mikroelektronika / Jaringan IoT -->
        <div class="logo-placeholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M19,9V7H17V3H13V5H11V3H7V7H5V9H3V13H5V15H7V19H11V17H13V19H17V15H19V13H21V9H19M17,15H15V17H9V15H7V9H9V7H15V9H17V15M11,11H13V13H11V11Z"/>
            </svg>
        </div>

        <h1>Simb<span>IoT</span></h1>
        <div class="status-badge">GATEWAY ONLINE & SECURED</div>
        
        <p>Infrastruktur Web App, Learning Management System, dan MQTT Broker berbasis Cloud untuk pembelajaran serta integrasi sistem tertanam pintar.</p>
        
        <a href="#" class="btn">Masuk ke Dashboard</a>

        <footer>
            &copy; 2026 SimbIoT Project. All Rights Reserved.
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>